WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.338 --> 00:00:04.215
In every neighborhood,  
there's always that one house 

00:00:04.221 --> 00:00:06.473
that you ride your bike past

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:09.509
just a little bit faster than the others.

00:00:17.142 --> 00:00:18.852
Who would do something like this?

00:00:21.351 --> 00:00:23.604
We now accepted that we were the hunted.

00:00:24.089 --> 00:00:25.131
I was scared to death.

00:00:26.615 --> 00:00:27.241
In one night,

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:29.863
police fielded fifty calls 

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:32.073
about a man in a rabbit suit with a hatchet.

00:00:34.347 --> 00:00:36.140
This was real.

00:00:36.661 --> 00:00:37.996
Now you’re locking windows,

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:38.830
you're locking doors.

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:42.751
I know that house

00:00:42.751 --> 00:00:44.711
and I know what it's capable of.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.586
There’s something wrong with this place.

